  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **(1st number)² + [1st number ****× (**1st number - 2**)] = 2nd number**.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 7 : 84\n\n→ (7)2 + [7 × (7 - 2)]\n\n→ 49 + [7 × 5]\n\n→ 49 + 35 = 84.\n\nFor, 9 : 144 \n\n→ (9)2 + [9 × (9 - 2)]\n\n→ 81 + [9 × 7]\n\n→ 81 + 63 = 144.\n\nSimilarly, for **5 : ?**\n\n**→ (5)2 + [5 × (5 - 2)]**\n\n**→ 25 + [5 × 3]**\n\n**→ 25 + 15 = 40.**\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is \"40\".**",
